"`greeting_counter_total` counter. But where can we see the metrics? Let's "
"browse to OpenShift Console in the `Developer > Monitoring` view, select "
"`Metrics`, then `Custom Query` and type `greeting_counter_total{name = "
"\"quarkus\"}`, we should see now:"
msgstr ""

